{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"ab618cbb8bfff895c2ec26e159ff1431b64be2ac953ce7c39800dcf1319558c6","digest":{"component_or_area":"LLM enrichment drain CLI and opportunistic async detached processor","key_entities":["src/rebar/llm/enrich_drain.py","src/rebar/_cli/_llm_commands.py","src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py","src/rebar/_store/event_append.py","src/rebar/_store/push.py","src/rebar/llm/config.py","rebar enrich","maybe_drain()","ENQUEUE_ENRICH","CLAIM_ENRICH","DONE_ENRICH",".rebar/enrich-drain.lock",".rebar/logs/enrich-drain.log","DRAIN_BATCH","DRAIN_GATE_BUDGET_MS","overlap_drain","overlap_drain_batch","overlap_drain_gate_budget_ms","REBAR_LLM_OVERLAP_DRAIN","queue.claim()","queue.pending_enrichment()","queue.reduce_ticket()","prune(keep=1)"],"problem_keywords":["opportunistic drain","async enrichment","detached process","queue claim","ticket digest","POSIX","advisory lock","event prune","write path","self-healing"],"propositions":["The drain must attach opportunistically to high-frequency write paths (create/edit/comment/link/tag/sign/set operations) via a cheap soaked-check gate in write_and_push and push_after_commit, spawning a detached child only when pending entries exist, within 20 ms budget.","POSIX drains detach with start_new_session and close_fds, logging to a bounded RotatingFileHandler at .rebar/logs/enrich-drain.log; Windows drain is a documented no-op in v1 because lock.py's unconditional fcntl import would crash a Windows child.","The drainer loop claims one ticket optimistically via queue.claim(), runs enrich, writes TICKET_DIGEST, appends DONE_ENRICH, then prunes the ticket's queue events retaining only the latest event (keep=1) to bound growth.","A separate advisory lock file .rebar/enrich-drain.lock (non-blocking O_CREAT|O_EXCL) prevents concurrent drain processes from redundant work; a held lock causes silent exit 0.","rebar enrich status outputs JSON {\"pending\":int,\"claimed\":int,\"soaking\":int} computed from mutually-exclusive queue predicates: soaking (not-yet-past-soak), claimed (live lease), pending (past-soak unclaimed-or-expired).","overlap_drain config (off|async|always, default async) enables opt-out, async detached drain (default), or synchronous inline drain (tests/CI); invalid values fall back to default."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785823987488603243,"uuid":"d6b27f1d-394f-4d9b-b7a5-45faf6692495"}